                                "sense_id": "69a7aeba-82d7-317b-8fa6-ca7784261b0b",
                                "text": "And such is the impression it makes upon the hill-wanderer who, perhaps for the first time, descends upon this semoted place to find its tidy cottages and emerald Green drowsing in the warmth and sunlight […]"
